      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEVRON STROLL (4) lines up here off a comfortable win at Geelong after jumping from box 1 (25.62). Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Expected to be right there at the finish again. SCOTT GREYSCALE (8) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame from Box 1 last run (25.50) at Shepparton. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Expected to be in the finish again. BRINDLE ROAD (1) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Shepparton over 450m behind Springer's Boy (25.78) in a Grade 5. Cannot be underestimated. TALTARNI BLUE (3) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
